/**
 * @page hp_type201_guide HP OEM Type 201: Rack Information Guide
 *
 * @brief HP OEM specific rack naming and identity information.
 *
 * @note Experimental: This HP OEM type is newly added and has not been tested
 * with real hardware dumps.
 * @warning Untested.
 *
 * @section hp_type201_selection Array result and ownership
 *
 * @ref lazybiosGetOemHpType201 returns every HP OEM Type 201 structure and writes
 * the number of parsed structures to `hp_type201_count`. Iterate the returned
 * @ref lazybiosOemHpType201_t array using that count, and pass the same count to
 * @ref lazybiosFreeOemHpType201. When assigned to `ctx->HpType201` (available
 * when `LAZYBIOS_OEM_HP` is defined), the corresponding `ctx->hptype201_count`
 * is used by @ref lazybiosCleanup.
 *
 * @section hp_type201_fields Fields
 *
 * This structure currently contains:
 * - `rack_name`: The name assigned to the rack containing the system.
 *
 * @see @ref api_hp_type201
 */
